title: "CNRS Scientific Toolkit"
message: "CNRS Scientific Toolkit v0.20.0 is an unreleased research candidate extending finite exact CNRS-H algebra and bounded interoperability. The experimental API does not imply formal verification of its Python implementation; cite the last published v0.19.0 release for released software."
